 "title": "Chosen dense compactifications of the two opens",
 "statement": "Let $C_i^0$ be the compactification selected by classical choice from the\nnonempty type witnessing compactifiability of $U_i\\to S$. Define\n\n$$\nC_i=\\mathsf{Dense}(C_i^0)\n=\\bigl(U_i\\hookrightarrow X_i\\longrightarrow S\\bigr).\n$$",
